1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,925
Your chart has ten indicators on it. Can you still see the price?

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:12,157
Most indicators are built from the same price data, so stacking them often tells you the same thing several times.

3
00:00:12,526 --> 00:00:14,357
And when they disagree, you freeze.

4
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:20,708
Pick two or three that do different jobs. One for trend, one for momentum, and volume.

5
00:00:21,056 --> 00:00:25,267
Meme Street has forty nine indicators, and free lessons to help you choose.

6
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:29,531
Practise with fewer, better indicators at memestreet.net.

